{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43502","headline":"云母屏风隔坐 · 无名氏","name":"云母屏风隔坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩障成云母，丹墀隔上公。\n才彰二纪盛，荣播一朝同。\n近玉初齐白，临花乍散红。\n凝姿分缥缈，转佩辨𤫩珑\n意惬恩偏厚，名新宠更崇。\n谁知历千古，犹自仰清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43502.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43502","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}